{"format":"hologram.registry.artifact/v1","id":"artifacthub/security-hub/fluentd","fetched":"2026-09-25T12:16:58.775Z","source":{"name":"Artifact Hub","api":"https://artifacthub.io/api/v1/packages/falco/security-hub/fluentd","page":"https://artifacthub.io/packages/falco/security-hub/fluentd"},"readme":"# FluentD Falco Rules\n\nA distributed, reliable key-value store for the most critical data of a distributed system\n\n## Unauthorized inbound tcp connection fluentd\n\nDetects inbound network connections to fluentd on unexpected ports\n\nAllowed inbound ports:\n\n* 31337\n\n## Unexpected spawned process fluentd\n\nDetects an unexpected process spawned in the fluentd container\n\nAllowed processes:\n\n* /bin/sh\n* /proc/self/exe\n* /usr/bin/ruby2.1\n* date\n* expr\n* fluentd\n* grep\n* run.sh\n* sed\n* stat\n\n## Unexpected file read or written by fluentd\n\nDetects an attempt to access a file readwrite other than below an expected list of paths\n\nAllowed file prefixes for readwrite:\n\n* /var/log","readmeBase":"https://github.com/falcosecurity/cloud-native-security-hub/resources/falco","publisher":{"name":"Falco","url":"https://artifacthub.io/packages/search?org=falco","official":false,"verified":false,"cncf":false},"registered":null,"updated":"2021-05-25T12:49:26.000Z","categories":["Monitoring and logging"],"keywords":["logging"],"license":null,"links":[{"name":"source","url":"https://github.com/falcosecurity/cloud-native-security-hub/blob/master/resources/falco/fluentd.yaml"},{"name":"Security Hub repository","url":"https://github.com/falcosecurity/cloud-native-security-hub/resources/falco"}],"maintainers":[],"stats":{"pulls":null,"stars":4,"subscriptions":0},"mediaTypes":[],"contentTypes":[],"storage":null,"tags":[{"name":"1.0.0","digest":null,"pushed":"2021-05-25T12:49:26.000Z","size":null,"platforms":[],"mediaType":null,"status":null,"appVersion":null}],"tagsTotal":1,"security":null,"install":null,"version":"1.0.0","appVersion":null,"containersImages":[],"cont